% The task graph of architecture section 72, with facts for the relations it
% leaves extensional.  A task is blocked while something it depends on is not
% done, and ready when it is not blocked.  done/1 is complete before
% blocked/1 is derived, and blocked/1 before ready/1, so each negation tests
% absence from a relation that can no longer grow.
%
% ship waits on build, which is not done, so ship is blocked.  build waits on
% design, which is done.  design and docs wait on nothing.
todo(design).
todo(build).
todo(ship).
todo(docs).

depends(build, design).
depends(ship, build).
depends(ship, docs).

done(design).

blocked(X) :-
    todo(X),
    depends(X, Y),
    not done(Y).

ready(X) :-
    todo(X),
    not blocked(X).

blocked(X)?
ready(X)?
